  "description": "Two Nexus vPC peers, dedicated management-VRF keepalive, two-member LACP peer-link, dual-homed IOS access, two VLANs, SVIs and orphan endpoints. Native access Po10 maps to simulator Po3 (local aggregate IDs need not match the vPC ID).",
